flowchart TD
  Need[Need a test?] --> Q1{Needs org rows?}
  Q1 -->|No| Insert[Insert LAB_ data; isolation default]
  Q1 -->|Only if Guide requires that object| See[SeeAllData=true with a comment; still assert]
