  Need --> Q3{Callout?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Mock[Test.setMock before the call]
  Need --> Q4{What to assert?}
  Q4 -->|Behavior| A[Field values, counts, exceptions, Limits]
  Q4 -->|Only percent| Bad[Not enough: coverage is not a test]
